          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6160' id='92' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='9800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#e91600' fontsize='12'>P.S. </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Orders and vendors per topic and per emotion have duplicates by nature:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>1) An order can be marked as either negative or positive; however, vendors can select multiple topics for it. Hence, same order can typically be counted several times inside different topics (but only once for each emotion).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>2) Same vendor can be counted twice in charts with # of vendorsfor the same reason as mentioned in point 1. Additionally, same vendor can leave different emotions for different riders, which will count them in both categories for the same date: those who left positive and those who left negative feedback.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='2161' id='93' mode='compact' param='[Parameters].[Parameter 1]' type-v2='paramctrl' w='98934' x='533' y='7639'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
